        "created_at": "2013-08-30T18:53:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>After a cursory glance the only thing I see wrong with it is not suggesting doing it while Fixed Point is out to do infinite damage to all non-hero targets.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Wow, that would be broken, but then when you finished you'd have to deal all the damage to Vis, so she'd be dead (outside of cocoon) when the point went away.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But really something this broken can't be allowed.</p>",
